{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_015_title", "source_sha256": "2fa65fadb97fbd81e22e07a02ff25b8766275b2a22ce788548e559d375faede8", "ja": "こちら、方針決まり次第、追加で依頼いたします。", "zh": "这边会在方针确定后，再追加委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_015_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2fa65fadb97fbd81e22e07a02ff25b8766275b2a22ce788548e559d375faede8", "ja": "こちら、方針決まり次第、追加で依頼いたします。", "zh": "这边会在方针确定后，再追加委托。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_015_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "75de2ed540aff3b5e569da7cfaaf93490014c50bd1a6911ca10d2500bef5989c", "ja": "ねえねえねえ、しほりん！\n最近みんな、どんどんセンターに\n選ばれていってるじゃん？", "zh": "欸欸欸，志保保！\n最近，大家不是一个接一个\n被选为Center吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_015_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "cce3081fc52c57ec194a73667ec7d19bc94f22bf723b60458648a00ac8aab3a8", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん、可奈ちゃんと\nきて……。そろそろ茜ちゃんの\n出番だと思わないかにゃ？？", "zh": "先是小杏奈、小可奈……\n你不觉得是时候\n要轮到小茜登场了喵？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_015_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "acd2b34e55eb7b4d5fbbef618371491a9d197baa1115c828da4758cde0560829", "ja": "さあ、どうでしょうか。\n私に言われても、わかりません。", "zh": "这可难说。\n你问我，我也不会知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_015_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "ce7c2aebdab872a8755a6f20893864db77001aa5464d01032043cc11c3510ea9", "ja": "そっか～。ん～、茜ちゃんが思うに\n{$P$}ちゃんは、\nきっとこう思ってるハズだよ！", "zh": "这样啊～嗯～小茜觉得\n小{$P$}，\n一定是这么打算的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_015_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "c76ce91e952318ea73d45d55657f33fd894bb75d3b40f59ac0904b0b3b95e928", "ja": "『次のセンターは茜ちゃん！\nそう、茜ちゃんしかいない！』\nってね♪", "zh": "『下个Center是小茜！\n没错，除了小茜没有其他可能！』\n他肯定这样想♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_015_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "92f3a137c21b204cfb51fa9fb7dadbff005be32785701426d3b5639b65f963b7", "ja": "ところで、しほりんはセンター\nやりたくないの？　いやいや、\nやりたいよね？　絶対やりたいよね？", "zh": "话说志保保不想当Center吗？\n不不不，你想当对吧？\n一定很想当对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_015_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "bd2a73494ba5a48c53fa18bf680f4446104a4ccaaffc993ad14975f83f31518f", "ja": "私の意思は、関係ありませんよね？\n全部{$P$}さんが\n決めることですから。", "zh": "我怎么想根本无所谓吧？\n毕竟一切全都要看\n{$P$}先生的安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_015_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_015_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "65c057b7d4f522130d1cb8e3ea5cdc0322f605056cc73422952c1a5cba9174c2", "ja": "前回のセンターが誰だとか、\n気にしても仕方ないじゃないですか。\nそんなの時間のムダです。", "zh": "在意上次Center是谁，\n总想着这种事又有什么用？\n只是在浪费时间而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
